<div id="gift-view-memory" phx-hook="ViewMemory" data-key={@editing_id && "starlight-gift-view-#{@editing_id}"} data-view={Jason.encode!(%{tab: @active_tab, milestone: @selected_milestone_id})} class="flex flex-col h-full gap-3 overflow-hidden">
  <datalist id="gift-name-options">
    <option :for={gift <- @gifts} value={gift.name} />
  </datalist>

  <StarlightBotWeb.Layouts.flash_toasts flash={@flash} />
  <% popup_gift = @gift_popup && @gifts_by_name[@gift_popup.name] %>
  <div id="gift-popup" phx-hook="GiftPopup" class="contents" data-gift={popup_gift && popup_gift.name} data-x={@gift_popup && @gift_popup.x} data-y={@gift_popup && @gift_popup.y}>
    <div :if={popup_gift} data-popup-control class="fixed z-50 w-max max-w-sm max-h-[calc(100vh-1rem)] overflow-y-auto rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-2 shadow-xl flex flex-col gap-1">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <img src={popup_gift.image_path} class="w-8 h-8 rounded object-cover shrink-0" />
        <div class="flex flex-col min-w-0">
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold"><%= popup_gift.name %></span>
          <span class="text-[10px] text-base-content/60">T<%= popup_gift.tier %><%= if popup_gift.affinity not in [nil, "none"], do: " · #{popup_gift.affinity}" %></span>
        </div>
        <div :if={uptie_view_available?(popup_gift, "uptie2", @gifts_by_id)} class="join ml-auto self-start">
          <% current = Enum.find_index(uptie_views(), &(&1 == @gift_popup.view)) %>
          <button :for={{level, index} <- Enum.with_index(uptie_views()) |> Enum.drop(1)} type="button" data-popup-control
                  phx-click="set_gift_popup_view" phx-value-level={if index == current, do: "base", else: level}
                  disabled={not uptie_view_available?(popup_gift, level, @gifts_by_id)}
                  class={"btn btn-xs join-item " <> if(index <= current, do: "btn-secondary", else: "btn-outline")}>
            <%= uptie_view_icon(level) %>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[11px] whitespace-pre-line"><%= gift_detail_text(popup_gift, @gift_popup.view, @gifts_by_id) %></p>
      <% ingredients = fusion_ingredients(popup_gift, @gifts_by_id, @theme_packs_by_gift_id) %>
      <div :if={ingredients} class="border-t border-base-300 pt-1 flex flex-col gap-0.5">
        <span class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide text-base-content/50">Fusion</span>
        <div :for={ingredient <- ingredients} class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px]">
          <img :if={ingredient.image_path} src={ingredient.image_path} class="w-4 h-4 rounded object-cover shrink-0" />
          <span :if={!ingredient.image_path} class="w-4 shrink-0"></span>
          <span><%= ingredient.name %></span>
          <span :if={ingredient.packs != []} class="ml-auto pl-3 text-[10px] text-base-content/50"><%= Enum.join(ingredient.packs, ", ") %></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p :if={@theme_packs_by_gift_id[popup_gift.id]} class="text-[10px] text-base-content/60">
        Theme pack: <%= Enum.join(@theme_packs_by_gift_id[popup_gift.id], ", ") %>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
    <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-lg flex flex-col flex-1 min-h-0 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="card-body p-3 flex flex-col flex-1 min-h-0 gap-3">
        <%= if @editing_id do %>
          <% issues = GiftPlans.issues(@plan_data, @gifts_by_name) %>

          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap">
            <.pane_tabs team_id={@team_id} pane="gifts" counts={@tab_counts} />
            <.template_picker id="gift-template-picker" templates={@templates} editing={@editing_template} current_count={@tab_counts[:gift_plans]} status={@paste_status} selected={@template_id} plans={@plans} plan_id={@editing_id} editing_plan={@editing_plan} label="gift plan" />
            <%= if @active_tab == :loadout do %>
              <button phx-click="set_tab" phx-value-tab="shop" class="btn btn-sm btn-accent w-32">Milestones</button>
            <% else %>
              <button id="gift-loadout-btn" phx-click="set_tab" phx-value-tab="loadout" title="Loadout" class="btn btn-sm gap-1 px-2 w-32 overflow-hidden btn-accent btn-outline">
                <img :for={name <- GiftPlans.cabinet_order(@plan_data)} :if={@gifts_by_name[name]} src={@gifts_by_name[name].image_path} class="w-4 h-4 rounded object-cover bg-slate-500/40 ring-1 ring-slate-400/40" />
                Loadout
              </button>
            <% end %>
            <div class="ml-auto flex items-center gap-3">
              <span :if={issues != []} class="badge badge-warning badge-sm" title={Enum.join(issues, "\n")}>
                <%= length(issues) %> issue(s)
              </span>
              <button type="button" phx-click="toggle_help" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline gap-0 overflow-hidden px-0" title="How gift plans work">
                <span class="flex h-full items-center border-r border-current/30 bg-base-content/10 px-2 text-xs">guide</span>
                <span class="flex h-full items-center px-2">
                  <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="h-4 w-4">
                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
                    <path d="M12 16v-4" />
                    <path d="M12 8h.01" />
                  </svg>
                </span>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <.read_only_banner container="gift-view-memory" allowed={read_only_events()} template_id={@template_id} templates={@templates} label="gift plan" />

          <div class="flex-1 min-h-0 flex flex-col gap-3 overflow-hidden">

              <% milestone = selected_milestone(assigns) %>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 grid-rows-[minmax(16rem,2fr)_minmax(0,3fr)] lg:grid-cols-[17rem_1fr] lg:grid-rows-1 gap-3 flex-1 min-h-0">
                <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 min-h-0 pr-1 max-lg:overflow-y-auto">
                  <div id="milestone-clipboard" phx-hook="ItemClipboard" class="flex flex-col gap-1 shrink-0 max-h-48 overflow-y-auto">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                      <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-base-content/70">Milestones</span>
                      <button type="button" data-paste-event="paste_milestone" title="Paste a milestone from the clipboard" class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs ml-auto">Paste</button>
                      <button phx-click="add_milestone" class="btn btn-primary btn-xs">+ New</button>
                    </div>
                    <div :for={{m, number} <- Enum.with_index(@plan_data["milestones"], 1)}
                         phx-click="select_milestone" phx-value-id={m["id"]}
                         class={"flex items-center gap-1 rounded px-2 py-1 cursor-pointer text-xs " <>
                           applies_row_color(m["applies"]) <> " " <> if(m["id"] == @selected_milestone_id and @active_tab == :shop, do: "border-l-2 border-primary ring-1 ring-primary/40", else: "hover:bg-base-200")}>
                      <span class="text-[10px] text-base-content/40 w-4 text-right shrink-0"><%= number %></span>
                      <%= if m["id"] == @editing_milestone_id do %>
                        <input id={"milestone-name-input-#{m["id"]}"} type="text" value={m["name"]} phx-hook="FocusSelect"
                               phx-blur="rename_milestone" phx-value-id={m["id"]} class="input input-bordered input-xs flex-1 min-w-0" />
                      <% else %>
                        <span id={"milestone-name-#{m["id"]}"} phx-hook="DblClickEvent" data-event="edit_milestone_name" data-id={m["id"]}
                              class="flex-1 truncate select-none"><%= m["name"] %></span>
                      <% end %>
                      <span :if={m["endless"] == true} class="rounded border border-warning bg-warning/20 px-1 text-[11px] font-bold leading-4 text-warning shrink-0">∞</span>
                      <button phx-click="copy_milestone" phx-value-id={m["id"]} title="Copy this milestone to the clipboard as JSON" class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs px-1">Copy</button>
                      <button phx-click="move_milestone" phx-value-id={m["id"]} phx-value-dir="up" class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs px-1">↑</button>
                      <button phx-click="move_milestone" phx-value-id={m["id"]} phx-value-dir="down" class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs px-1">↓</button>
                      <button phx-click="delete_milestone" phx-value-id={m["id"]} data-confirm={"Delete milestone '#{m["name"]}'?"}
                              class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs text-error">✕</button>
                    </div>
                    <div :if={@plan_data["milestones"] == []} class="text-[11px] text-base-content/40 italic">None yet.</div>
                  </div>
                  <div :if={issues != []} class="flex flex-col gap-1 text-[11px] text-warning shrink-0 max-h-24 overflow-y-auto">
                    <span :for={issue <- issues}><%= issue %></span>
                  </div>

                  <%= if @active_tab == :loadout or milestone do %>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0">
                      <input type="text" placeholder="Search gifts…" value={@gift_filter} phx-keyup="filter_gifts"
                             class="input input-bordered input-xs flex-1 min-w-0" />
                      <button :if={@gift_tier_filter != [] or @gift_affinity_filter != [] or @gift_fixed_filter} type="button" phx-click="clear_gift_filters" title="Clear all filters"
                              class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs btn-square">✕</button>
                      <details class="dropdown dropdown-end" phx-mounted={JS.ignore_attributes("open")} phx-click-away={JS.remove_attribute("open")}>
                        <summary title="Filter"
                             class={"btn btn-xs btn-square " <> if(@gift_tier_filter != [] or @gift_affinity_filter != [] or @gift_fixed_filter, do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-ghost")}>
                          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"><path d="M22 3H2l8 9.46V19l4 2v-8.54L22 3z" /></svg>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="dropdown-content z-30 mt-1 w-56 rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-200 p-2 shadow-lg ring-2 ring-base-content/20 space-y-2">
                          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">Tier</span>
                            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1">
                              <button :for={tier <- gift_tiers()} type="button" phx-click="set_gift_tier_filter" value={tier}
                                      class={"btn btn-xs " <> if(tier in @gift_tier_filter, do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-ghost border-base-300")}>
                                <%= gift_tier_roman(tier) %>
                              </button>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">Affinity</span>
                            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1">
                              <button :for={affinity <- affinities()} type="button" phx-click="set_gift_affinity_filter" value={affinity} title={affinity}
                                      class={"btn btn-xs btn-square " <> if(affinity in @gift_affinity_filter, do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-ghost border-base-300")}>
                                <img src={gift_affinity_icon(affinity)} alt={affinity} class="w-4 h-4" />
                              </button>
                              <button type="button" phx-click="set_gift_affinity_filter" value="none"
                                      class={"btn btn-xs " <> if("none" in @gift_affinity_filter, do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-ghost border-base-300")}>
                                none
                              </button>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">Fusion</span>
                            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1">
                              <button type="button" phx-click="toggle_gift_fixed_filter"
                                      class={"btn btn-xs " <> if(@gift_fixed_filter, do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-ghost border-base-300")}>
                                Fixed fusions
                              </button>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </details>
                      <div class="dropdown dropdown-end">
                        <div tabindex="0" role="button" title={"Sort: #{gift_sort_label(@gift_sort)}"}
                             class={"btn btn-xs btn-square " <> if(@gift_sort != "default", do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-ghost")}>
                          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"><path d="m21 16-4 4-4-4" /><path d="M17 20V4" /><path d="m3 8 4-4 4 4" /><path d="M7 4v16" /></svg>
                        </div>
                        <div tabindex="0" class="dropdown-content z-30 mt-1 w-36 rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-200 p-1 shadow-lg ring-2 ring-base-content/20">
                          <button :for={sort_by <- gift_sorts()} type="button" phx-click="set_gift_sort" value={sort_by}
                                  class={"btn btn-xs w-full justify-start " <> if(@gift_sort == sort_by, do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-ghost")}>
                            <%= gift_sort_label(sort_by) %>
                          </button>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <% picks = @plan_data["gift_search"] %>
                    <% shown = filtered_gifts(if(@active_tab == :loadout, do: searchable_gifts(@gifts), else: @gifts), @gift_filter, @gift_tier_filter, @gift_affinity_filter, @gift_fixed_filter, @gift_sort) %>
                    <div id="gift-drag-source" phx-hook="GiftDragSource" class="flex flex-col flex-1 min-h-0 max-lg:min-h-28 overflow-y-auto">
                      <% added? = fn gift -> if(@active_tab == :loadout, do: gift.name in picks, else: GiftPlans.has_gift?(milestone, gift.name)) end %>
                      <div :for={gift <- shown} data-drag-gift={if not added?.(gift), do: gift.name} class="flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded px-1 py-0.5 hover:bg-base-200">
                        <div data-gift-popup={gift.name} class="relative w-7 h-7 shrink-0 rounded overflow-hidden bg-base-200 ring-1 ring-base-300 cursor-pointer">
                          <img src={gift.image_path} class="w-full h-full object-cover" draggable="false" />
                          <img :if={gift.affinity not in [nil, "none"]} src={gift_affinity_icon(gift.affinity)} title={gift.affinity} draggable="false"
                               class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 object-contain drop-shadow" />
                        </div>
                        <span :if={gift.tier} class="text-[10px] text-base-content/50 w-4 shrink-0">T<%= gift.tier %></span>
                        <span data-gift-popup={gift.name} class={"text-[11px] truncate flex-1 min-w-0 select-none " <> if(added?.(gift), do: "cursor-pointer", else: "cursor-grab")} title={gift.name}><%= gift.name %></span>
                        <%= if @active_tab == :loadout do %>
                          <%= if gift.name in picks do %>
                            <button phx-click="toggle_search_gift" phx-value-gift={gift.name} class="btn btn-xs btn-primary" title="Remove from gift search">Added</button>
                          <% else %>
                            <button phx-click="toggle_search_gift" phx-value-gift={gift.name} disabled={length(picks) >= GiftPlans.gift_search_max()}
                                    class="btn btn-xs btn-outline" title="Add to gift search">Add</button>
                          <% end %>
                        <% else %>
                        <%= if GiftPlans.has_gift?(milestone, gift.name) do %>
                          <button class="btn btn-xs btn-primary" disabled>Added</button>
                        <% else %>
                          <button phx-click="ms_add_gift" phx-value-gift={gift.name} class="btn btn-xs btn-outline"
                                  title={if GiftPlans.fixed_recipe?(gift), do: "Also adds its ingredients"}>Add</button>
                        <% end %>
                        <% end %>
                      </div>
                      <div :if={shown == []} class="text-xs text-base-content/40 italic p-1">No matching gifts.</div>
                    </div>
                  <% end %>
                </div>
                <div id="gift-drop-zone" phx-hook="GiftDropZone"
                     data-drop-event={if @active_tab == :loadout, do: "toggle_search_gift", else: milestone && "ms_add_gift"}
                     class="flex flex-col gap-3 overflow-y-auto min-h-0 pr-1 rounded-lg transition-colors">
                  <%= if @active_tab == :loadout do %>
              <div class="flex items-end gap-3 flex-wrap">
                <form phx-change="set_affinity" class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                  <span class="text-xs font-medium text-base-content/70">Affinity</span>
                  <details class="dropdown">
                    <summary class="btn btn-outline bg-base-100 font-normal normal-case gap-1.5 justify-start min-w-36">
                      <img :if={@plan_data["affinity"] not in [nil, ""]} src={gift_affinity_icon(@plan_data["affinity"])} class="w-4 h-4 object-contain" />
                      <%= if @plan_data["affinity"] in [nil, ""], do: "none", else: @plan_data["affinity"] %>
                    </summary>
                    <ul class="dropdown-content menu bg-base-100 rounded-box border border-base-300 shadow z-20 w-40 p-1">
                      <li>
                        <label class="cursor-pointer">
                          <input type="radio" name="affinity" value="" checked={@plan_data["affinity"] in [nil, ""]} class="hidden" />none
                        </label>
                      </li>
                      <li :for={affinity <- affinities()}>
                        <label class="cursor-pointer">
                          <input type="radio" name="affinity" value={affinity} checked={@plan_data["affinity"] == affinity} class="hidden" />
                          <img src={gift_affinity_icon(affinity)} class="w-4 h-4 object-contain" /><%= affinity %>
                        </label>
                      </li>
                    </ul>
                  </details>
                </form>
                <div :if={GiftPlans.cabinet_order(@plan_data) != []} id="cabinet-gift-order" phx-hook="SortableList"
                     data-sort-event="reorder_cabinet_gifts" data-sort-scope="cabinet" data-sort-axis="x" class="flex items-center gap-1 min-[600px]:gap-2"
                     title="Starting gift pick order. The cabinet only allows as many picks as your graces give.">
                  <div :for={{name, index} <- Enum.with_index(GiftPlans.cabinet_order(@plan_data), 1)} data-sort-id={name}
                       class="flex items-center gap-1 min-[600px]:gap-2 min-w-0 rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-200 p-1 min-[600px]:p-2 min-h-10 min-[600px]:min-h-14">
                    <span data-sort-handle class="cursor-grab text-base-content/40 select-none">⠿</span>
                    <span class="text-[10px] text-base-content/40"><%= index %></span>
                    <% gift = @gifts_by_name[name] %>
                    <img :if={gift} src={gift.image_path} class="w-6 h-6 min-[600px]:w-10 min-[600px]:h-10 rounded object-cover" />
                    <span class="text-[10px] min-[600px]:text-xs font-semibold truncate"><%= name %></span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="divider my-0"></div>

              <% picks = @plan_data["gift_search"] %>
              <% max = GiftPlans.gift_search_max() %>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="text-xs font-medium text-base-content/70">
                    Gifts to pick on the gift search screen after the cabinet, on every run. Up to <%= max %>, Tier 3 and under.
                    Leave empty to skip gift search.
                  </span>
                  <span :if={picks != []} class="badge badge-warning badge-sm ml-auto whitespace-nowrap">
                    <%= GiftPlans.gift_search_starlight_cost(length(picks)) %> Starlight
                  </span>
                  <span class={"badge badge-primary badge-sm whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 " <> if(picks == [], do: "ml-auto", else: "")}><%= length(picks) %> / <%= max %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
                  <%= for slot <- 0..(max - 1) do %>
                    <% name = Enum.at(picks, slot) %>
                    <% gift = name && @gifts_by_name[name] %>
                    <div class={"rounded-lg border p-2 flex items-center gap-2 min-h-14 " <>
                           if(name, do: "bg-primary/10 border-primary", else: "border-dashed border-base-300")}>
                      <%= if name do %>
                        <div data-gift-popup={name} class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-1 min-w-0 text-left cursor-pointer">
                          <img :if={gift} src={gift.image_path} class="w-10 h-10 rounded object-cover" />
                          <div class="flex flex-col flex-1 min-w-0">
                            <span class="text-xs font-semibold truncate" title={name}><%= name %></span>
                            <span :if={gift} class="text-[10px] text-base-content/60">
                              T<%= gift.tier %> · <%= GiftPlans.gift_search_tab(gift) %> tab
                            </span>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <span class="badge badge-warning badge-xs whitespace-nowrap"><%= GiftPlans.gift_search_slot_cost(slot) %> Starlight</span>
                        <button phx-click="toggle_search_gift" phx-value-gift={name} class="btn btn-ghost btn-2xs px-1">✕</button>
                      <% else %>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/40 italic flex-1">Empty slot</span>
                        <span class="badge badge-ghost badge-xs whitespace-nowrap">+<%= GiftPlans.gift_search_slot_cost(slot) %> Starlight</span>
                      <% end %>
                    </div>
                  <% end %>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="divider my-0"></div>

              <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="text-xs font-medium text-base-content/70">
                    Starter buffs to select at grace, on every run. Multi-select, pick an enhancement tier per grace.
                  </span>
                  <span class="badge badge-primary badge-sm ml-auto whitespace-nowrap shrink-0"><%= grace_total_cost(@plan_data) %> Starlight total</span>
                </div>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 grid-rows-5 min-[600px]:grid-cols-5 min-[600px]:grid-rows-2 gap-2">
                  <%= for {grace, number} <- Enum.with_index(graces(), 1) do %>
                    <% pick = grace_pick(@plan_data, grace.index) %>
                    <% level = if pick, do: pick["enhance"], else: 0 %>
                    <div phx-click="toggle_grace" phx-value-index={grace.index}
                         class={"cursor-pointer rounded-lg border p-2 flex flex-col gap-1 min-w-0 " <>
                           if(pick, do: "bg-primary/10 border-primary", else: "border-base-300 hover:bg-base-200")}>
                      <span class="text-xs font-semibold"><%= number %>. <%= grace.name %></span>
                      <span class="badge badge-ghost badge-xs self-start max-w-full"><span class="truncate"><%= grace_level_cost(grace, level) %> Starlight</span></span>
                      <p class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60 leading-snug"><%= grace_effect(grace, level) %></p>
                      <div class="join w-full mt-auto pt-1">
                        <button :for={enhance_level <- [1, 2]} type="button" phx-click="set_grace_enhance"
                                phx-value-index={grace.index} phx-value-level={if pick && level == enhance_level, do: 0, else: enhance_level}
                                class={"btn btn-xs join-item flex-1 " <> if(pick && level >= enhance_level, do: "btn-secondary", else: "btn-outline")}>
                          <%= grace_enhance_icon(enhance_level) %>
                        </button>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  <% end %>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="divider my-0"></div>

              <% rows = @plan_data["mounting_trials"] %>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-base-content/70">Mounting Trials</span>
                  <button type="button" phx-click="add_mounting_row" disabled={Enum.any?(rows, &(&1["from_floor"] >= 15))}
                          class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs ml-auto">Add Schedule</button>
                </div>
                <form phx-change="update_mounting" class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                  <div :for={{row, index} <- Enum.with_index(rows)} class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-1 py-1">
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-base-content/70 w-12 shrink-0 px-1">from</span>
                    <span :if={index == 0} class="text-[11px] font-semibold w-12 px-1">F1</span>
                    <select :if={index > 0} name={"rows[#{index}][from_floor]"} class="select select-bordered select-xs w-16">
                      <option :for={floor <- 1..15} value={floor} selected={row["from_floor"] == floor}>F<%= floor %></option>
                    </select>
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-base-content/70">pick</span>
                    <select name={"rows[#{index}][mode]"} class="select select-bordered select-xs">
                      <option :for={mode <- GiftPlans.mounting_trials_modes()} value={mode} selected={row["mode"] == mode}><%= GiftPlans.mounting_trials_mode_label(mode) %></option>
                    </select>
                    <button type="button" phx-click="remove_mounting_row" phx-value-index={index} class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs px-1 text-error ml-auto">✕</button>
                  </div>
                </form>
                <span :if={rows == []} class="text-[11px] text-base-content/50 italic">No floors set; every floor uses best gift.</span>
              </div>

              <div class="divider my-0"></div>

              <% encounter_rows = @plan_data["encounter_rewards"] %>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-base-content/70">Encounter Reward</span>
                  <button type="button" phx-click="add_encounter_row" disabled={Enum.any?(encounter_rows, &(&1["from_floor"] >= 15))}
                          class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs ml-auto">Add Schedule</button>
                </div>
                <div :for={{row, index} <- Enum.with_index(encounter_rows)} class="flex flex-col gap-1 rounded border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-1 py-1">
                  <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                    <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-base-content/70 w-12 shrink-0 px-1">from</span>
                    <span :if={index == 0} class="text-[11px] font-semibold w-12 px-1">F1</span>
                    <form :if={index > 0} phx-change="set_encounter_floor">
                      <input type="hidden" name="index" value={index} />
                      <select name="from_floor" class="select select-bordered select-xs w-16">
                        <option :for={floor <- 1..15} value={floor} selected={row["from_floor"] == floor}>F<%= floor %></option>
                      </select>
                    </form>
                    <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/50">first visible, top to bottom</span>
                    <button :if={index > 0} type="button" phx-click="remove_encounter_row" phx-value-index={index} class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs px-1 text-error ml-auto">✕</button>
                  </div>
                  <div class="flex flex-col gap-1 pl-1">
                    <div id={"encounter-order-#{index}"} phx-hook="SortableList" data-sort-event="reorder_encounter" data-sort-scope={index} class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                      <div :for={{key, position} <- Enum.with_index(row["order"])} data-sort-id={key} class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded border border-base-300 bg-base-100 px-2 py-0.5">
                        <span data-sort-handle class="cursor-grab text-base-content/40 select-none">⠿</span>
                        <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/50 w-4"><%= position + 1 %></span>
                        <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold"><%= GiftPlans.encounter_reward_label(key) %></span>
                        <button type="button" phx-click="encounter_remove" phx-value-index={index} phx-value-key={key} class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs px-1 text-error ml-auto">✕</button>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1 rounded border border-dashed border-base-300 px-2 py-0.5">
                      <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/50 w-4"><%= length(row["order"]) + 1 %></span>
                      <span class="text-[11px] italic text-base-content/60">Highest tier available</span>
                    </div>
                    <div :if={GiftPlans.encounter_reward_options() -- row["order"] != []} class="flex items-center gap-1 flex-wrap">
                      <button :for={key <- GiftPlans.encounter_reward_options() -- row["order"]} type="button" phx-click="encounter_add" phx-value-index={index} phx-value-key={key}
                              class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs">+ <%= GiftPlans.encounter_reward_label(key) %></button>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
                  <% else %>
                  <%= if milestone do %>
                    <div class="flex items-start gap-2">
                      <div class={"flex items-stretch gap-2 flex-wrap flex-1 min-w-0 rounded-xl border " <> applies_group_color(milestone["applies"])}>
                        <div class="dropdown">
                          <div tabindex="0" role="button" title={applies_hint(milestone["applies"] || "always")}
                               class={"h-full rounded-lg border px-2 py-1 flex items-center text-[11px] font-semibold cursor-pointer " <> applies_badge_color(milestone["applies"])}>
                            <%= if milestone["applies"] not in [nil, "always"], do: "When: " %><%= applies_label(milestone["applies"] || "always") %><%= if milestone["applies"] not in [nil, "always"], do: " do →" %>
                          </div>
                          <div tabindex="0" class="dropdown-content z-30 mt-1 w-40 rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-1 shadow-lg">
                            <button :for={option <- GiftPlans.milestone_applies_options()} type="button" phx-click="ms_set_applies" phx-value-applies={option} title={applies_hint(option)}
                                    class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs w-full justify-start"><%= applies_label(option) %></button>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class={"rounded-lg border px-2 py-1 flex flex-col justify-center " <> goal_color("required")}>
                          <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold">Required</span>
                          <span class="text-[10px] text-base-content/50">all of <%= goal_member_count(milestone, "required") %></span>
                        </div>
                        <form :for={goal <- milestone["goals"]} phx-change="ms_set_goal_min"
                              class={"rounded-lg border px-2 py-1 flex items-center gap-1 " <> goal_color(goal["letter"])}>
                          <input type="hidden" name="letter" value={goal["letter"]} />
                          <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold"><%= goal["letter"] %>:</span>
                          <span class="text-[11px]">at least</span>
                          <input type="number" min="1" name="min" value={goal["min"]} phx-debounce="400" class="input input-bordered input-xs w-12" />
                          <span class="text-[11px]">of <%= goal_member_count(milestone, goal["letter"]) %></span>
                          <button type="button" phx-click="ms_remove_goal" phx-value-letter={goal["letter"]} class="btn btn-ghost btn-2xs px-1 text-error"
                                  title="Remove this goal; its entries become required">✕</button>
                        </form>
                        <button phx-click="ms_add_goal" class="rounded-lg border border-dashed border-base-content/30 px-3 text-[11px] text-base-content/60 hover:bg-base-200">+ Goal</button>
                        <div :if={milestone["endless"] == true} class="rounded-lg border border-warning bg-warning/20 px-2 py-1 flex items-center gap-1 text-warning"
                             title="This milestone is never reached. It keeps buying and refreshing until a refresh case leaves the shop, and later milestones are not run.">
                          <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold">∞ Never done</span>
                          <button type="button" phx-click="ms_set_endless" phx-value-endless="false" class="btn btn-ghost btn-2xs px-1 text-error" title="Make this milestone finishable again">✕</button>
                        </div>
                        <button :if={milestone["endless"] != true} type="button" phx-click="ms_set_endless" phx-value-endless="true"
                                title="Never count this milestone as reached, so it keeps going until a refresh case leaves the shop"
                                class="rounded-lg border border-dashed border-base-content/30 px-3 text-[11px] text-base-content/60 hover:bg-base-200">+ Endless</button>
                      </div>
                      <div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-1 shrink-0 ml-auto">
                      <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
                        <div :for={{action, label} <- [{"heal", "+ Greatly heal"}, {"revive", "+ Revive"}]} class="dropdown dropdown-end">
                          <div tabindex="0" role="button" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline"><%= label %></div>
                          <div tabindex="0" class="dropdown-content z-30 mt-1 w-80 max-w-[90vw] rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-1 shadow-lg"><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-1">
                            <button :for={sinner <- @sinners} type="button" phx-click="ms_add_action" phx-value-action={action} phx-value-sinner={sinner}
                                    title={sinner_label(sinner)} class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs min-w-0 flex-nowrap justify-start gap-1 px-1">
                              <img src={StarlightBot.SinnerProfiles.icon(sinner)} class="sinner-icon h-4 w-4 shrink-0 object-contain" /><span class="truncate"><%= sinner_label(sinner) %></span>
                            </button>
                          </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <button type="button" phx-click="ms_add_action" phx-value-action="heal_all" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline">+ Heal all</button>
                        <div class="dropdown dropdown-end">
                          <div tabindex="0" role="button" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline">+ Skill replace</div>
                          <div tabindex="0" class="dropdown-content z-30 mt-1 w-80 max-w-[90vw] rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-1 shadow-lg"><div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-1">
                            <button :for={sinner <- @sinners} type="button" phx-click="ms_add_action" phx-value-action="skill_replace" phx-value-sinner={sinner}
                                    title={sinner_label(sinner)} class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs min-w-0 flex-nowrap justify-start gap-1 px-1">
                              <img src={StarlightBot.SinnerProfiles.icon(sinner)} class="sinner-icon h-4 w-4 shrink-0 object-contain" /><span class="truncate"><%= sinner_label(sinner) %></span>
                            </button>
                          </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <% offers = loadout_offers(@plan_data, milestone) %>
                      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 flex-wrap justify-end">
                        <div :if={offers != []} class="flex items-center gap-1 flex-wrap justify-end" title="Gifts you start with that this milestone doesn't list. Adds them as optional keeps.">
                          <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">Loadout</span>
                          <button :for={{name, source} <- offers} type="button" phx-click="ms_add_loadout_gift" phx-value-gift={name}
                                  title={source} class="btn btn-xs btn-outline gap-1 px-1">
                            <img :if={@gifts_by_name[name]} src={@gifts_by_name[name].image_path} class="w-4 h-4 rounded object-cover bg-slate-500/40" />
                            + <%= name %>
                          </button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-1"
                             title="Any-tier and any-affinity entries never count toward goals and never keep anything. Buy buys matches when nothing wanted is on the shelf; Sell sells matches at the start of Work on Milestone. A specific gift entry overrides them.">
                          <div class="dropdown dropdown-end">
                            <div tabindex="0" role="button" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline">+Any tier</div>
                            <div tabindex="0" class="dropdown-content z-30 mt-1 w-36 rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-1 shadow-lg">
                              <button :for={affinity <- affinities()} type="button" phx-click="ms_add_affinity_any" phx-value-affinity={affinity}
                                      class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs w-full justify-start capitalize">
                                <img src={gift_affinity_icon(affinity)} class="w-3.5 h-3.5 object-contain" /><%= affinity %>
                              </button>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          <div :for={tier <- GiftPlans.shop_tiers()} class="dropdown dropdown-end">
                            <div tabindex="0" role="button" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline">+T<%= tier %></div>
                            <div tabindex="0" class="dropdown-content z-30 mt-1 w-36 rounded-lg border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-1 shadow-lg">
                              <button type="button" phx-click="ms_add_tier" phx-value-tier={tier} class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs w-full justify-start">Any</button>
                              <button :for={affinity <- affinities()} type="button" phx-click="ms_add_affinity" phx-value-affinity={affinity} phx-value-tier={tier}
                                      class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs w-full justify-start capitalize">
                                <img src={gift_affinity_icon(affinity)} class="w-3.5 h-3.5 object-contain" /><%= affinity %>
                              </button>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <.milestone_entries milestone={milestone} entry_tabs={@entry_tabs} gifts_by_name={@gifts_by_name} gifts_by_id={@gifts_by_id} />
                    <div :if={Enum.all?(milestone["entries"], &GiftPlans.action_entry?/1)} class="text-xs text-base-content/40 italic">No entries yet. Add gifts from the search on the left.</div>

                    <% refresh_from = active_refresh_from(@refresh_tabs, milestone) %>
                    <% refresh_scheduled = milestone["refresh_scheduled"] == true %>
                    <div class="flex flex-col">
                      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 pb-1">
                        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-base-content/70">Refresh</span>
                        <button phx-click="ms_add_refresh_case" class="btn btn-xs btn-outline">+ Case</button>
                        <button :if={not refresh_scheduled} type="button" phx-click="ms_refresh_add_schedule" class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs ml-auto">Add Schedule</button>
                      </div>
                      <.refresh_tabs :if={refresh_scheduled} milestone={milestone} from={refresh_from} />
                      <div class={"flex flex-col gap-1 " <> if(refresh_scheduled, do: "p-1 border-2 border-primary rounded-b-lg rounded-tr-lg", else: "")}>
                        <div id={"refresh-cases-#{milestone["id"]}-#{refresh_from}"} phx-hook="SortableList" data-sort-event="ms_reorder_refresh" data-sort-scope={milestone["id"]}
                             class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                          <div :for={{refresh_case, index} <- Enum.with_index(GiftPlans.refresh_cases(milestone, refresh_from))} data-sort-id={refresh_case["id"]}
                               class="rounded border border-base-300 bg-base-200 px-1 py-1 flex items-start gap-2">
                            <span data-sort-handle class="cursor-grab text-base-content/40 select-none px-1 leading-6">⠿</span>
                            <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-base-content/70 w-12 shrink-0 leading-6"><%= if index == 0, do: "if", else: "else if" %></span>
                            <div class="flex-1 min-w-64">
                              <%= if refresh_case["condition"] do %>
                                <%= if @editing_condition_case_id == refresh_case["id"] do %>
                                  <div phx-click-away="close_case_condition" class="flex items-start gap-1">
                                    <button type="button" phx-click="close_case_condition" title="Close the condition editor" class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs h-6 min-h-6 px-1">▾</button>
                                    <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
                                      <.condition_node node={refresh_case["condition"]} path="" values={%{"case_id" => refresh_case["id"]}} removable={false}
                                                       leaf={&gift_leaf(Map.merge(&1, %{plan_data: @plan_data, milestone_host: milestone["id"]}))} />
                                    </div>
                                  </div>
                                <% else %>
                                  <button type="button" phx-click="open_case_condition" phx-value-case_id={refresh_case["id"]}
                                          class="btn btn-outline btn-xs bg-base-100 h-6 min-h-6 w-full justify-start font-normal normal-case">
                                    <span class="text-base-content/50">▸</span><span class="truncate"><%= GiftPlans.condition_label(refresh_case["condition"], @plan_data) || "always" %></span>
                                  </button>
                                <% end %>
                              <% else %>
                                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 h-6">
                                  <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">always</span>
                                  <button type="button" phx-click="cond_add" phx-value-case_id={refresh_case["id"]} phx-value-path="" phx-value-node="leaf"
                                          class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs">+ Condition</button>
                                </div>
                              <% end %>
                            </div>
                            <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-base-content/70 leading-6">then</span>
                            <form phx-change="ms_update_refresh_case" class="flex items-center gap-1 shrink-0">
                              <input type="hidden" name="case_id" value={refresh_case["id"]} />
                              <select name="action" class="select select-bordered select-xs">
                                <option :for={action <- GiftPlans.refresh_actions()} value={action} selected={refresh_case["action"] == action}><%= GiftPlans.refresh_action_label(action) %></option>
                              </select>
                              <details :if={refresh_case["action"] == "affinity_refresh"} class="dropdown">
                                <summary class="btn btn-xs btn-outline bg-base-100 font-normal normal-case gap-1">
                                  <img :if={refresh_case["affinity"]} src={gift_affinity_icon(refresh_case["affinity"])} class="w-3 h-3 object-contain" />
                                  <%= refresh_case["affinity"] || "plan affinity" %>
                                </summary>
                                <ul class="dropdown-content menu menu-xs bg-base-100 rounded-box border border-base-300 shadow z-20 w-36 p-1">
                                  <li>
                                    <label class="cursor-pointer">
                                      <input type="radio" name="affinity" value="" checked={refresh_case["affinity"] == nil} class="hidden" />plan affinity
                                    </label>
                                  </li>
                                  <li :for={affinity <- affinities()}>
                                    <label class="cursor-pointer">
                                      <input type="radio" name="affinity" value={affinity} checked={refresh_case["affinity"] == affinity} class="hidden" />
                                      <img src={gift_affinity_icon(affinity)} class="w-3 h-3 object-contain" /><%= affinity %>
                                    </label>
                                  </li>
                                </ul>
                              </details>
                              <span :if={refresh_case["action"] != "leave"} class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-base-content/70">up to</span>
                              <input :if={refresh_case["action"] != "leave"} type="number" name="max" min="0" value={refresh_case["max"]} placeholder="∞"
                                     phx-debounce="300" class="input input-bordered input-xs w-14" />
                            </form>
                            <button type="button" phx-click="ms_remove_refresh_case" phx-value-case_id={refresh_case["id"]} class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs px-1 text-error">✕</button>
                          </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="rounded border border-dashed border-base-300 px-1 py-1 flex items-center gap-2">
                          <span class="px-1 invisible">⠿</span>
                          <span class="text-[11px] font-semibold text-base-content/70 w-12 shrink-0"><%= if GiftPlans.refresh_cases(milestone, refresh_from) == [], do: "always", else: "else" %></span>
                          <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">stop working on this milestone</span>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <% fusion_entry = @fusion_entry_id && GiftPlans.find_entry(milestone, @fusion_entry_id) %>
                    <% target = fusion_entry && @gifts_by_name[GiftPlans.subject_gift(fusion_entry)] %>
                    <div :if={fusion_entry && target && fusion_entry["fusion"]} class="modal modal-open">
                      <div class="modal-box w-11/12 max-w-4xl h-[85vh] flex flex-col gap-2">
                        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                          <img src={target.image_path} class="w-10 h-10 rounded object-cover" />
                          <div class="flex flex-col">
                            <span class="text-sm font-semibold"><%= target.name %></span>
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">Tier <%= target.tier %> · <%= target.affinity %> · <%= fusion_entry["fusion"]["type"] %> fusion</span>
                          </div>
                          <button phx-click="ms_close_fusion" class="btn btn-sm btn-ghost ml-auto">Close</button>
                        </div>
                        <%= if GiftPlans.fixed_fusion?(fusion_entry) do %>
                          <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">
                            Fixed recipe. Each ingredient is its own entry in this milestone: a missing one is bought if its entry has Buy on,
                            otherwise fused if its entry has Fuse on. Red ingredients aren't in the milestone, so they're never bought or fused for this.
                          </span>
                          <.recipe_tree gift={target} milestone={milestone} gifts_by_id={@gifts_by_id} gifts_by_name={@gifts_by_name} />
                        <% else %>
                          <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">
                            Routes, tried in order. Each picks a combo from the valid pool and can buy missing ingredients up to a tier,
                            demand leftover unkept items before fusing, and fuse sub-goals for its ingredient tiers.
                            Normal shops skip combos marked super only. These routes are shared by every floor of this entry.
                          </span>
                          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <button type="button" phx-click="rt_copy" phx-value-def_id={fusion_entry["id"]} class="btn btn-xs">Copy routes</button>
                            <button type="button" phx-click="rt_paste" phx-value-def_id={fusion_entry["id"]} class="btn btn-xs"
                                    disabled={is_nil(@route_clipboard) or @route_clipboard.tier != target.tier}
                                    data-confirm="Replace all routes with the copied ones?">Paste routes</button>
                            <span :if={@route_clipboard} class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">
                              Clipboard: <%= @route_clipboard.name %> (T<%= @route_clipboard.tier %>, <%= length(@route_clipboard.routes) %> route(s))
                            </span>
                          </div>
                          <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">T<%= target.tier %> templates</span>
                            <span :if={@route_templates[target.tier] == []} class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">No T<%= target.tier %> templates yet</span>
                            <div :for={template <- @route_templates[target.tier] || []} class="flex items-center gap-2">
                              <button type="button" phx-click="rt_apply_template" phx-value-def_id={fusion_entry["id"]} phx-value-ref={template.ref} class="btn btn-xs"
                                      data-confirm={"Replace all routes with the template #{template.name}?"}>Apply</button>
                              <span class="text-xs font-semibold"><%= template.name %></span>
                              <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60"><%= Enum.map_join(template.routes, ", ", &Routes.label/1) %></span>
                              <button :if={template.deletable} type="button" phx-click="rt_delete_template" phx-value-ref={template.ref} class="btn btn-xs btn-ghost"
                                      data-confirm={"Delete the template #{template.name}?"}>Delete</button>
                            </div>
                            <form phx-submit="rt_save_template" class="flex items-center gap-2">
                              <input type="hidden" name="def_id" value={fusion_entry["id"]} />
                              <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Template name" autocomplete="off" class="input input-xs input-bordered" />
                              <button type="submit" class="btn btn-xs">Save routes as T<%= target.tier %> template</button>
                            </form>
                          </div>
                          <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span class="text-[11px] text-base-content/60">Routes for</span>
                            <div class="join">
                              <button :for={shop <- [:normal, :super]} type="button" phx-click="set_route_shop" phx-value-shop={shop}
                                      class={"btn btn-xs join-item " <> if(@route_shop == shop, do: "btn-primary", else: "btn-outline")}>
                                <%= if shop == :normal, do: "Normal shop", else: "Super shop" %>
                              </button>
                            </div>
                          </div>
                          <.route_list def_id={fusion_entry["id"]} routes={fusion_entry["fusion"]["routes"] || []} tier={target.tier} shop={@route_shop} />
                        <% end %>
                      </div>
                      <div class="modal-backdrop" phx-click="ms_close_fusion"></div>
                    </div>
                  <% else %>
                    <div class="text-xs text-base-content/40 italic">Create a milestone to edit it here.</div>
                  <% end %>
                  <% end %>
                </div>
              </div>
            

          </div>

        <% else %>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <.pane_tabs team_id={@team_id} pane="gifts" counts={@tab_counts} />
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 flex flex-col gap-2 items-center justify-center text-base-content/40 text-sm">
            This team has no gift plan.
            <button type="button" phx-click="new_plan" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">+ New gift plan</button>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    </div>
  <%= if @show_help do %>
    <div class="modal modal-open" phx-window-keydown="toggle_help" phx-key="Escape">
      <div class="modal-box max-w-3xl max-h-[85vh] flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm">
        <h2 class="font-bold text-base">How gift plans work</h2>
        <div class="overflow-y-auto flex flex-col gap-3 pr-1">
          <section>
            <h4 class="font-semibold mb-1">Two parts</h4>
            <p><span class="font-medium">Loadout</span> is everything set up before the first shop: the starting gift, gift search, graces and mounting trials. It applies to every run. <span class="font-medium">Milestones</span> drive what the bot buys, keeps, fuses and refreshes in each shop. Switch between them with the button at the top.</p>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h4 class="font-semibold mb-1">Milestones</h4>
            <p>Milestones run top to bottom. The bot works on one in each shop until its goals are met, then moves to the next. Drag gifts from the search on the left into the milestone, or use Add.</p>
            <ul class="mt-1 list-disc pl-5 flex flex-col gap-1">
              <li><span class="font-medium">When</span> limits a milestone to certain runs: every run, normal F1-F5, hard starting F2-F5, hard from F1, or extreme planned. It follows the run's theme pack plan. Rows are tinted to match.</li>
              <li><span class="font-medium">Required</span> entries must all be owned. Extra goals ("at least N of") let a group of entries count as one requirement.</li>
              <li><span class="font-medium">Any-tier and any-affinity</span> entries never count toward goals and never keep anything. Buy buys matches when no wanted gift is on the shelf, and Sell sells matches at the start of the milestone. A specific gift entry overrides them.</li>
              <li><span class="font-medium">Fixed fusions</span> add their ingredients too. Open a fusion entry to choose its routes. See <span class="font-mono text-xs">docs/fusion.md</span> for the fusion rules.</li>
              <li><span class="font-medium">Greatly heal</span> and <span class="font-medium">Revive</span> pick sinners to restore while working on the milestone.</li>
              <li><span class="font-medium">&infin; Endless</span> means the milestone is never reached. It keeps buying and refreshing until a refresh case leaves the shop, and later milestones never run.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h4 class="font-semibold mb-1">Refresh</h4>
            <p>Cases are checked top to bottom, like if / else if. The first case whose condition is true runs its action: Refresh, Keyword Refresh or Leave Shop, optionally up to a maximum count. If no case matches, the bot stops working on the milestone.</p>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h4 class="font-semibold mb-1">Loadout</h4>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 flex flex-col gap-1">
              <li><span class="font-medium">Affinity and cabinet order</span>: the starting gift picks, in order. The cabinet only allows as many picks as your graces give.</li>
              <li><span class="font-medium">Gift search</span>: gifts to pick on the gift search screen after the cabinet, Tier 3 and under. Each slot costs <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-base-300 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-medium align-middle"><img src="/images/icons/starlight.webp" alt="Starlight" class="h-3 w-3" />starlight</span>. Leave it empty to skip gift search.</li>
              <li><span class="font-medium">Graces</span>: starter buffs, each with two enhancement tiers. Pick the ones to select on every run; the total Starlight cost is shown.</li>
              <li><span class="font-medium">Mounting trials</span>: from a floor onward, either avoid boosting enemy HP or take the best gift. With no rows every floor takes the best gift.</li>
              <li><span class="font-medium">Encounter rewards</span>: from a floor onward, the order of reward types. The first one visible on screen is taken; if none is, the highest tier available.</li>
            </ul>
          </section>
          <section>
            <h4 class="font-semibold mb-1">Issues</h4>
            <p>The badge in the corner lists problems found in the plan. Hover it for the details.</p>
          </section>
        </div>
        <div class="modal-action mt-0">
          <button phx-click="toggle_help" class="btn btn-sm">Close</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-backdrop" phx-click="toggle_help"></div>
    </div>
  <% end %>
</div>
